<style>
  .ttfaq-wrap *,
  .ttfaq-wrap *::before,
  .ttfaq-wrap *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  .ttfaq-wrap {
    background: #0d0d0d;
    color: #f0f0f0;
    font-family: inherit;
    padding: 60px 24px 80px;
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    border-radius: 12px;
  }

  .ttfaq-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .ttfaq-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    background: rgba(201,168,76,0.12);
    border: 1px solid #c9a84c;
    color: #c9a84c;
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 4px 14px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .ttfaq-title {
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 2.6rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #ffffff;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .ttfaq-title span { color: #c9a84c; }

  .ttfaq-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: #888;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .ttfaq-divider {
    width: 60px;
    height: 3px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #c9a84c, transparent);
    margin: 20px auto 0;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  .ttfaq-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
  }

  .ttfaq-item {
    background: #161616;
    border: 1px solid #2a2a2a;
    border-radius: 8px;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .ttfaq-item:hover {
    border-color: #c9a84c44;
  }

  .ttfaq-item.open {
    border-color: #c9a84c66;
  }

  .ttfaq-q {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 20px 24px;
    cursor: pointer;
    gap: 16px;
    user-select: none;
  }

  .ttfaq-q-text {
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #f0f0f0;
    line-height: 1.4;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .ttfaq-icon {
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    min-width: 28px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(201,168,76,0.1);
    border: 1px solid #c9a84c44;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: #c9a84c;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    transition: transform 0.25s ease, background 0.2s ease;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .ttfaq-item.open .ttfaq-icon {
    transform: rotate(45deg);
    background: rgba(201,168,76,0.2);
  }

  .ttfaq-a {
    display: none;
    padding: 0 24px 24px;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: #aaa;
    line-height: 1.85;
    border-top: 1px solid #222;
  }

  .ttfaq-item.open .ttfaq-a {
    display: block;
  }

  .ttfaq-a a {
    color: #c9a84c;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .ttfaq-a a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

  .ttfaq-a strong { color: #f0f0f0; }

  .ttfaq-a code {
    background: #1e1e1e;
    color: #c9a84c;
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    word-break: break-all;
  }

  .ttfaq-a p { margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .ttfaq-a p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

  .ttfaq-a ol,
  .ttfaq-a ul {
    padding-left: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .ttfaq-a li { margin-bottom: 6px; }

  .split-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin: 16px 0;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .split-table th {
    text-align: left;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    background: #1a1a1a;
    color: #888;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #2a2a2a;
  }

  .split-table td {
    padding: 10px 12px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #1e1e1e;
    color: #ccc;
    vertical-align: top;
  }

  .split-table td:last-child {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #c9a84c;
  }

  .stake-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin: 16px 0;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .stake-table th {
    text-align: left;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    background: #1a1a1a;
    color: #888;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #2a2a2a;
  }

  .stake-table td {
    padding: 10px 12px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #1e1e1e;
    color: #ccc;
  }

  .stake-table td:nth-child(3) {
    color: #c9a84c;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .audit-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    background: rgba(72,187,120,0.1);
    border: 1px solid #48bb78;
    color: #68d391;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 4px 12px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    margin-right: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .ttfaq-cta {
    margin-top: 48px;
    text-align: center;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #161616, #1a1508);
    border: 1px solid #c9a84c44;
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 36px 24px;
  }

  .ttfaq-cta-title {
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 1.7rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #c9a84c;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .ttfaq-cta p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: #888;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .ttfaq-btn {
    display: inline-block;
    background: #c9a84c;
    color: #0d0d0d;
    font-family: inherit;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 1rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 14px 36px;
    border-radius: 50px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background 0.2s;
  }

  .ttfaq-btn:hover { background: #e0be6a; }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .ttfaq-title { font-size: 1.9rem; }
    .ttfaq-q { padding: 16px 18px; }
    .ttfaq-a { padding: 0 18px 18px; }
    .split-table, .stake-table { font-size: 0.9rem; }
    .split-table th, .split-table td,
    .stake-table th, .stake-table td { padding: 8px 8px; }
  }
</style>

<div class="ttfaq-wrap">

  <div class="ttfaq-header">
    <div class="ttfaq-badge">Official FAQ</div>
    <h1 class="ttfaq-title">Temptation Token <span>$TTS</span> — FAQ</h1>
    <p class="ttfaq-subtitle">Updated May 2026 · Base Blockchain · Everything you need to know</p>
    <div class="ttfaq-divider"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="ttfaq-list">

    <div class="ttfaq-item open">
      <div class="ttfaq-q" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
        <span class="ttfaq-q-text">What is Temptation Token?</span>
        <span class="ttfaq-icon">+</span>
      </div>
      <div class="ttfaq-a">
        <p><strong>Temptation Token ($TTS)</strong> is the first vote-to-earn cryptocurrency game on <strong>Base blockchain</strong> — Coinbase's Ethereum Layer 2. Launched April 2026.</p>
        <p>Each week, approved profiles compete in a voting round. Players spend $TTS tokens to vote on profiles. At round close, <strong>Chainlink VRF</strong> selects the winner — weighted by votes, so more votes means better odds. Prizes are automatically paid by the smart contract with zero human involvement.</p>
        <p>Play now at <a href="https://app.temptationtoken.io" target="_blank">app.temptationtoken.io</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ttfaq-item">
      <div class="ttfaq-q" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
        <span class="ttfaq-q-text">How does voting work? What are the prize splits?</span>
        <span class="ttfaq-icon">+</span>
      </div>
      <div class="ttfaq-a">
        <p>Connect your wallet at <a href="https://app.temptationtoken.io" target="_blank">app.temptationtoken.io</a>, hold $TTS, and vote a minimum of 5 $TTS on any approved profile. Votes are final and non-refundable.</p>
        <p>When the round ends (Sunday 11:59 PM EDT), the smart contract automatically splits the prize pool:</p>
        <table class="split-table">
          <thead><tr><th>Recipient</th><th>Share</th><th>Details</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>🏆 Top Voter</td><td>35%</td><td>Wallet that voted most $TTS on winning profile</td></tr>
            <tr><td>📸 Winning Profile</td><td>35%</td><td>Profile's registered wallet</td></tr>
            <tr><td>💙 Polaris Project</td><td>10%</td><td>Anti-trafficking charity — hardcoded</td></tr>
            <tr><td>🏢 Blockchain Entertainment LLC</td><td>20%</td><td>House cut (operations)</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
        <p><strong>With a club partner:</strong> When a winning profile was submitted via a club referral code, the 20% house share splits — 10% to the club, 10% to the house. All other splits remain the same.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ttfaq-item">
      <div class="ttfaq-q" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
        <span class="ttfaq-q-text">What blockchain is $TTS on? Is it still on Base?</span>
        <span class="ttfaq-icon">+</span>
      </div>
      <div class="ttfaq-a">
        <p><strong>Temptation Token is on Base mainnet</strong> (Chain ID: 8453) — Coinbase's Ethereum Layer 2. It is <strong>not on Base.</strong> Any previous references to Base are outdated and should be disregarded.</p>
        <p>Base offers fees typically under $0.01 per transaction with Ethereum-level security. You need ETH on Base for gas, and $TTS on Base to play.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ttfaq-item">
      <div class="ttfaq-q" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
        <span class="ttfaq-q-text">How do I buy $TTS on Base?</span>
        <span class="ttfaq-icon">+</span>
      </div>
      <div class="ttfaq-a">
        <p>$TTS trades on Uniswap V2 on Base. Step by step:</p>
        <ol>
          <li>Install <strong>MetaMask</strong> or use <strong>Coinbase Wallet</strong></li>
          <li>Add Base network (Chain ID: 8453, RPC: mainnet.base.org)</li>
          <li>Bridge ETH to Base via <a href="https://bridge.base.org" target="_blank">bridge.base.org</a></li>
          <li>Go to <a href="https://app.uniswap.org" target="_blank">app.uniswap.org</a> on Base network</li>
          <li>Paste the contract: <code>0x5570eA97d53A53170e973894A9Fa7feb5785d3b9</code></li>
          <li>Set slippage to <strong>2%+</strong> (1% transfer tax requires this)</li>
          <li>Swap ETH → $TTS</li>
        </ol>
        <p><strong>Important:</strong> Only buy from the official contract above. Always verify on <a href="https://basescan.org/token/0x5570eA97d53A53170e973894A9Fa7feb5785d3b9" target="_blank">BaseScan</a>. There are copycat tokens.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ttfaq-item">
      <div class="ttfaq-q" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
        <span class="ttfaq-q-text">How do I submit a profile to compete?</span>
        <span class="ttfaq-icon">+</span>
      </div>
      <div class="ttfaq-a">
        <ol>
          <li>Connect your wallet at <a href="https://app.temptationtoken.io" target="_blank">app.temptationtoken.io</a></li>
          <li>Go to the <strong>Submit</strong> tab</li>
          <li>Upload a photo and enter your display name</li>
          <li>Pay the <strong>5 $TTS submission fee</strong></li>
          <li>Admin reviews your submission (SFW content only — typically same day)</li>
          <li>Once approved, you appear in the current or next round</li>
        </ol>
        <p><strong>Requirements:</strong> Safe for work photos only. No nudity, no explicit content, no minors. Submission fees are non-refundable whether approved or rejected.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ttfaq-item">
      <div class="ttfaq-q" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
        <span class="ttfaq-q-text">What is staking? What APR can I earn?</span>
        <span class="ttfaq-icon">+</span>
      </div>
      <div class="ttfaq-a">
        <p>Stake $TTS to earn weekly yield <strong>and</strong> multiply your voting power. Five tiers based on USD value staked (calculated live from the Uniswap price):</p>
        <table class="stake-table">
          <thead><tr><th>Tier</th><th>Min Stake (USD)</th><th>APR</th><th>Vote Multiplier</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>🥉 Bronze</td><td>$50+</td><td>8%</td><td>1.1x</td></tr>
